# Go lean defaults

Use **ponytail** (full) and **lean-build** on every coding task in this repo.

- Stdlib first (`net/http`, `log`, `testing`). No framework/dep unless asked.
- Fewest files, shortest working code. No scaffolding for later.
- No extra endpoints, config, middleware, Docker, or README unless requested.
- Surface errors; no empty catches. Validate only at trust boundaries.
- After verifying, stop the server yourself. Never leave :8080 / hello.exe running.
